        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "All seven Southern California counties: Los Angeles, Orange, Ventura, Santa Barbara, San Bernardino, Riverside, and San Diego. We dispatch from 10 service territories so the technician is coming from the closest one. A failed door drives up refrigeration cost and food-safety risk every hour it leaks, so door calls get same-day priority across most of LA, Orange, and Ventura, and next-day for the Inland Empire. Phones answered 24/7, $120 commercial diagnostic, no emergency surcharge."
      }
